    'Vendor' => 'Furnizuesi',
    'If you want a one-month frame, this is most often positioned as 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™, 1 x Forever ImmuBlend, 1 x Forever B12 Plus and 1 x Forever Active Pro B.' => 'Nëse dëshiron një plan njëmujor, zakonisht përfshihen 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™, 1 x Forever ImmuBlend, 1 x Forever B12 Plus dhe 1 x Forever Active Pro B.',
    'Bug' => 'Gabim',
